  "prefLabel": "Plu 203.01 Principles of Dispute Resolution",
  "priorExpiration": "1997-08-28",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plu 203.01 Principles of Dispute Resolution. The board shall resolve by agreement or by a decision all disputes about non-criminal matters within the scope of RSA 329-A and the administrative rules implementing that statute.\n\nSource. #2069, eff 7-1-82; ss by #2733, eff 5-31-84; ss by #4264, eff 6-8-87; ss by #5213, eff 8-28-91, EXPIRED: 8-28-97\n\nNew. #8464, eff 10-28-05",
